        <p>84, BRIDGE STREET, WARRINGTON. Hours cf Business 9.0 to 7.C0. Saturdny 9.:20 to 9. PLEASE NOTE 'Johnston Watson Etteads on Mcnday nnd Tuesday from 11 to 4.30, Wednesday 11 to 5.30 Thtusday 11 to 1, Friday and Sattaday 11 to 5.:.10, or by al pcintmeat.</p>
