        <head>NORTHERN UNION.</head>
        <p>THE NORTHERN UNION.</p>
        <p>Results of Saturday's Matches.</p>
        <p>THE NORTHERN RUGBY LEAGU E.</p>
        <p>G. T. P. G. T. P. Huddersfield *Batley 1 1 5 Hunslet K,ighley *Hull. Bradt( ri *Wakefield T. *Warrington *Runcorn *Barrow 2 2 10 Widnes_ . 1 2 8</p>
