      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-09-25_WidnesExaminer_art0094" n="art0094">
        <head>PEARSON AND liNOWLES R.F.C.</head>
        <p>PEARSON AND liNOWLES R.F.C.</p>
        <p>Sept. 25 St. Helens Waite Rose away Oct. 2 Earlest own Y.N1.0 1 home 9 Rylands' Rec. home 23 Thatto llta:h Lorne Nov. C St. Helens White. Rc.e home 13 Earlestown Y.M.O Lome 20 Denton Green away Dec. 4 Westfield Amateurs 11. Widnes White Star away Jan. 1 Rylands Rec away 8 Sr. Helens Rangers home 15 Green End tway 22 Widnes Rovers home 29 Westfield Amateurs 'may Feb. 5 Matto Heath 19 St. Helens Rangers away -Arta. 5- Widnes Rovers away 12 Green End home 26 Widnes White Star home</p>
        <p>Ryland's men played their first match last Saturday at Matto Heath and won by 29 points to 11. P. and K. opened their League programme at Waders- pnol against Denton Green, and after a Len 6ame woa by 13 points to 12. -</p>
