      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-09-25_WidnesExaminer_art0104" n="art0104">
        <head>VETERAN WALKS ONE HUNDRED MILES.</head>
        <p>VETERAN WALKS ONE HUNDRED MILES.</p>
        <p>Mr. L. Norwood, of the Sheffield United Harriers, distinguished himself by covering 100 miles in the twenty-four hours' walk at the Stadium. Mr. Norwood, who is sixty years of age, is a vegetarian, and neither smokes nor drinks. _</p>
