        <head>Winw!ck.</head>
        <p>Winw!ck.</p>
        <p>,TRAIN ON FIRE.—.In expris3 frcm the North vas I.4lssing through Golbarne about Vac° o'clock on i:'-onday,.afternoon when a tignalman r.o.i.:ed that a e box attached to the train was on pre. Ho at Zr_lce informed the signraman at IVirtwick Junctit n of fact and he brought the express to a standstill. truck was at once detachedand the fire extinguished r'it a horse which was in tte box nad been literally ec'?-3ted to death. There wai WO a cage vhich Lad :Idently contained ce.narics az.-d thfte had suffered a -Izilar fate.</p>
