        <p>14 •=flik</p>
        <p>but also to the working men, who are the priccipal sufferers from the exportation of British capital." Upon a show of bands being taken, the resolution had only a small majority, and was declared carried, amidst cries of " Threls.ch9ers for Lloyd-George."</p>
