        <p>LONDON (NIErROPOLITAN) TITURSDAY.—Busi- nes3 at this morning's market proved quite a nominal affair. Arrivals of both beasts and sheep being too small to form reliable quotations. DUBLIN, THURSDAY.—Marketed : 4,121 beasts and 10,035 sheep, &amp;c. Trade again very (lull, and prices further depressed ; cattle lOs to 20s, and sheep 2s to 4s lower. No demand for heavy mutton. Quotations : Beef, 47s Gd to Ns per cwt. Mutton, 4d to Gd per lb.</p>
